 "description": "How is this EDINET filing related to other filings, as EDINET's document list states explicitly? One hop each: parent document (parentDocID: amendment, change report base, withdrawal), child documents, filer, large shareholding issuer, tender offer subject and listed subsidiaries, plus FSA correction and non-disclosure records. Each relation names its basis field. Targets not in the index are returned as unresolved with reason candidates, never guessed.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
